{
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "tool",
      "name": "quote",
      "output_key": "quote",
      "tool": "market_quote",
      "args": {
        "ticker": "{{question}}"
      },
      "fail_ok": true
    },
    {
      "type": "tool",
      "name": "path",
      "output_key": "path",
      "tool": "candlesticks",
      "args": {
        "ticker": "{{question}}",
        "hours_back": 0.75,
        "hourly": false
      },
      "fail_ok": true
    },
    {
      "type": "tool",
      "name": "tape",
      "output_key": "tape",
      "tool": "previous_trades",
      "args": {
        "ticker": "{{question}}",
        "limit": 20
      },
      "fail_ok": true
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "analyze",
      "output_key": "analysis",
      "prompt": "Contract: {{question}}\nGame state: {{game}}\nCurrent book: {{quote}}\nMinute bars (last 45m): {{path}}\nRecent prints: {{tape}}\n\nAnalyze the price dynamics:\n\n1. MOMENTUM: Look at the last 5-10 minute bars. Is price trending up/down or stable? Calculate rough velocity (cents per minute over last 3-5 minutes).\n\n2. TIME DECAY: If we're past 70', does the leading team's win probability naturally increase as clock runs? How many cents per 5 minutes?\n\n3. RECENT EVENT ABSORPTION: If there was a goal in the last 10 minutes, has the price stabilized (3+ minutes flat) or still moving?\n\n4. TAPE DIRECTION: Are recent trades biased one way (70%+ on one side)? This suggests continued flow.\n\n5. VOLATILITY: Has price moved 5+ cents in the last 2 minutes? If so, it may revert or continue - which?\n\nBe quantitative. Estimate cents of move expected from each factor.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "momentum_cents_per_5min": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "If current velocity continues, how many cents in 5 minutes?"
          },
          "time_decay_cents_per_5min": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Natural decay as clock runs (0 if before 70', or if tied)"
          },
          "recent_event_absorbed": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Has any recent goal/card been fully priced in?"
          },
          "tape_bias": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["strong_buy", "buy", "neutral", "sell", "strong_sell"],
            "description": "Direction of recent order flow"
          },
          "volatility_state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["quiet", "normal", "elevated", "spike"],
            "description": "How much has price moved in last 2-3 minutes?"
          },
          "reasoning": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Brief quantitative summary of each factor"
          }
        },
        "required": ["momentum_cents_per_5min", "time_decay_cents_per_5min", "recent_event_absorbed", "tape_bias", "volatility_state", "reasoning"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "predict",
      "output_key": "prediction",
      "prompt": "Contract: {{question}}\nGame: {{game}}\nCurrent mid: {{quote.mid}}\n\nAnalysis:\n{{analysis}}\n\nNow forecast the next 5 minutes. Combine the factors:\n- If momentum is strong and tape supports it, trust the trend\n- Add time decay if applicable (late in match with a lead)\n- If volatility is elevated and recent event NOT absorbed, expect continuation\n- If quiet and absorbed, predict 0\n\nYour delta_cents should be the sum of momentum + time_decay + any unfinished move.\nYour half_width should reflect confidence: tight (1-2c) if very confident, wide (4-5c) if uncertain.\n\nRemember: 0 is correct only when truly nothing is happening. Small moves (1-3 cents) are common and worth predicting.\nThe market moves a lot - don't default to 0 unless analysis strongly supports it.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "delta_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "How many cents the mid will MOVE over the next five minutes. Negative for down, 0 for no move. Do not state a price — state the change."
          },
          "half_width_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Half the width of the tightest two-sided market you would actually stand behind, in cents."
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "0-1. How sure, given how thin and noisy this book is."
          },
          "driver": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The one thing you expect to move it, or why nothing will."
          },
          "falsifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "What would show this call was wrong, before settlement."
          }
        },
        "required": ["delta_cents", "half_width_cents", "confidence", "driver", "falsifier"],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  ]
}

